Scope

The MIT License above covers this repository's own code, data and
documentation. It does not cover fonts:

- Font files in fonts/ that are built from Libertinus Serif (the patched,
  draft and test fonts, e.g. LibertinusSerif-*-patch.otf) and the copied
  LibertinusSerif-*.sfd sources are Modified Versions of Libertinus Serif and
  are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1; see
  fonts/LibertinusSerif-OFL.txt.
- The unmodified third-party fonts in fonts/ remain under their own licenses;
  see fonts/LICENSES.md.
- Brill fonts are not distributed with this repository (Brill Fonts EULA).

Documents (such as PDFs) created using the fonts are not subject to the font
licenses; see the OFL, condition 5, and fonts/LICENSES.md for Brill.
